# Input

```scss
$enabled :true;
@function identity( $value ){ @return $value; }
.enabled{color:red if( $enabled,/* before */!important/* after */,null );}
.disabled { color :red if(false ,
  /* disabled before */ !important /* disabled after */ ,null);}
.ordinary {color:red identity(
/* ordinary before */ !important /* ordinary after */
);}
.controls{ color:red!important; color:if(style(--enabled: true):red;else:blue)!important; }

```


# Formatted

```scss
$enabled: true;
@function identity($value) {
	@return $value;
}
.enabled {
	color: red if($enabled, /* before */ !important /* after */, null);
}
.disabled {
	color: red
		if(false, /* disabled before */ !important /* disabled after */, null);
}
.ordinary {
	color: red identity(/* ordinary before */ !important /* ordinary after */);
}
.controls {
	color: red !important;
	color: if(style(--enabled: true): red; else: blue) !important;
}

```
